                    "message": "I feel like somewhere somehow a disclaimer is needed saying a lot of this code doesn't exist yet.  Because if someone outside of IBM were to read all of this, they would think it does a lot more than it does, and also that some applications like phosphor-chassis-power exist, even though they won't for quite a while.\n\nEither that, or don't submit this until the code is done."
